# ADR-1208 D2's first macro, as the scenario tests play it: the console
# draws Cullet Mono at 11 pt, and the change is saved. A test never runs
# live, so the macro has no Set Live line. The look's card has no Ctrl+S
# row in the key table, so Escape goes back to the looks before Save.
Alt+L
Expect At looks
Click "console"
Enter
Click "Font set"
Enter
Click "cullet-mono"
Enter
Click "Size"
Enter
Click "11 pt"
Enter
Expect "cullet-mono"
Expect "11 pt"
Escape
Ctrl+S
Enter
Expect Saved
